 0|> consul                                                                                                             2/5
 1|  ENV         HOST           WHAT                                       │ newstg-consul1
 2|▌ NEW STAGING newstg-consul1 consul server 1 — mgmt                     │ user       ubuntu
 3|  NEW STAGING newstg-consul2                                            │ hostname   10.11.212.191
 4|                                                                        │ port       22
 5|                                                                        │ proxyjump  newstg-bastion
 6|                                                                        │
 7|
 8|  Enter                       - ssh to the selected host
 9|  Esc, Ctrl-C, Ctrl-G, Ctrl-Q - quit (exit 130); Esc closes this help first
10|  Up, Ctrl-P, Ctrl-K          - select the previous host; wraps to the last
11|  Down, Ctrl-N, Ctrl-J        - select the next host; wraps to the first
12|  type                        - filter; 'exact ^prefix suffix$ !not
13|  Backspace, Ctrl-H           - delete the last character
14|  Ctrl-U                      - clear the filter
15|  Ctrl-W                      - delete the last word
16|  Ctrl-D                      - quit when the filter is empty
17|  ?, F1                       - toggle this help (? only on an empty filter)
18|  ↑↓ move   enter ssh   esc close
